	(text "Switched and measured supply of the XC2064 (VCC_FPGA).\nU2: load switch with quick output discharge: off pulls VCC_FPGA to 0 V, as the XC2064 needs\n< 0.1 V for a clean power-on reset. R23 = 0R uses the internal discharge resistor, a larger\nvalue discharges more slowly. R8: VCC_FPGA stays on while the Mega is in reset.\nC5 sets the rise time: 2.0 V -> 4.75 V must take < 25 ms (check against the TPS22917 data sheet).\nU3: INA226 at I2C address 0x40, shunt R9 = 1 R: 2.5 uA/LSB, up to 82 mA, bus voltage = VCC_FPGA.\nBehind the shunt: the XC2064, its decoupling and the pull-ups R1-R7\n(current only while the Mega pulls a configuration pin low). LEDs and buffer run from +5V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 72.136 178.816 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ace8d3fc-21e0-5702-9e90-072ee2228596")
	)
